{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/allowEditDetailView-c.property","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Allows\/disables a detail view for editing items’ values. Default: TRUE.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/alloweditdetailview-c.property"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"readwrite"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowEditDetailView"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Detail views are automatically generated for editing new items. You can control wether the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view appears as a modal view or gets pushed to the navigation stack using the detailViewModal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property. Modal views have the added feature of giving the end user a Cancel and Done buttons."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The Cancel button cancels all user’s actions, while the Done button commits them. Also, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cell’s validation is enabled, the Done button will remain disabled until all cells’ values"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are valid."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCArrayOfItemsSection(py)allowEditDetailView","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"allowEditDetailView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"allowEditDetailView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"allowEditDetailView","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection/allowEditDetailView-c.property":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"allowEditDetailView"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Allows\/disables a detail view for editing items’ values. Default: TRUE.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"allowEditDetailView","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/allowEditDetailView-c.property","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/alloweditdetailview-c.property","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to represent an array"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of any kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"}}}